# Drawn art: icons and portraits by tools/anima, laid locally, not kept in git (the blanks of icons/_blank and the letter stand in)
/game/assets/icons/*
!/game/assets/icons/_blank/
!/game/assets/icons/README.md
/game/assets/portraits/
# The interface's frames: cut by tools/anima/ui/frames.py from the drawn parts, not kept in git (the theme's flat styles stand in)
/game/assets/ui/frames/
